# ::tok The report believes that the content ecology of the e - commerce industry is a comprehensive concept that integrates e - commerce and content , but not all content can be integrated with e - commerce . Good PGC ( professional production content ) and UGC ( user - generated content ) are high - quality carriers for integration with e - commerce . The higher the value of the content platform , the more abundant the consumption and promotion scenarios , the higher the possibility of e - commerce implantation , and the stronger the commercial value . The proportion of e - commerce content production and content consumption will be higher as the public and private domains are gradually integrated and distributed .
