# ::tok The Tourism Bureau organized a large - scale Hong Kong delegation of more than 100 people from the tourism department of the Hong Kong government , tourism industry and media representatives to Macau . The two - day ( 10th and 11th ) schedule included working meetings and industry talks , and Hong Kong travel agency industry and media representatives visited many tourist attractions , hotels and tourism - related facilities in Macau in batches to introduce the latest Macau tourism products to the Hong Kong market , and at the same time promote the linkage of cultural tourism between the two places , and jointly expand the market of " connected travel " between Hong Kong and Macau .
