# ::tok The 100 - person large - scale Hong Kong delegation includes leaders of tourism - related departments of the Hong Kong government , more than 60 representatives from travel agencies and cross - border transportation operators from Hong Kong and Macau , and about 30 reporters from travel magazines and newspapers , travel social media , Internet media representatives and bloggers / Internet celebrities , etc. , to visit Macau for exchanges and investigations to learn about the latest tourism resources in Macau . The Hong Kong industry and media will bring new ways of traveling in Macau to Hong Kong residents and tourists , and take advantage of Hong Kong 's transportation hub to expand the market of " connected travel " between Hong Kong and Macau .
