# ::tok Personally , I think it is acceptable . First , the price is cheap , and more than 700 pages are divided into two volumes , which are easy to read as paperbacks . Second , it is different from Michelangelo 's complete works , which mainly consist of paintings . Da Vinci 's black and white manuscripts account for the majority . For readers with limited budgets and non - art majors , this edition is the most cost - effective for appreciating paintings and manuscripts .
