# ::tok I think this collection of novels , and its title , is like a kind of performance art . What the author wants to express is that love is not only the joys and sorrows on the stage , the sea dryness and rocks in urban legends , and it is not just the glue between you and me . Not only the above should not be represented by the above , love is also a life as plain as water , boring day after day , there is also a loss of life , evasion of reality , and confusion of the future .
