# ::tok First of all , I just bought it a few days ago and found that the price has been reduced . Bad reviews , the book is not bad , and the price is high . The cpu and graphics card are enough for mainstream online games and quite a few large single machines . The heat dissipation is very good , but the screen is a bit light leaking ( ips screen common problems ) , the audio quality is not very good , the hard disk is not good ( it is recommended to spend some money to add a solid state ) , I took it to the after - sales service yesterday to test the hardware , there is no problem , the built - in win 8.1 is not very easy to use , it is recommended to upgrade to 10 . The seller delivered the goods quickly , and answered all inquiries very quickly . The invoice arrived the next day after receiving the computer . Not bad , but unfortunately there are no gifts .
